Virtual Environments
I created two virtual environments because the latest Python version is not
currently compatible with some Transformers dependencies.

Required Packages
1. opencv-python – Image and video processing.
2. cvzone – Simplifies common computer vision tasks.
3. ultralytics – YOLO models for object detection and training.
4. transformers - Provides access to pretrained AI models for tasks such as
                   OCR, image classification, and text processing.

Installation
pip install opencv-python cvzone ultralytics
